    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d262">

                <pb facs="0356" n="346" xml:id="pg346"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/7–748: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Peiping</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Touchette</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-07-07">July 7,
                        1948</date>.<lb/>[Received July 7—9:18 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>262. ReContel 261, July 6. Martial law still in effect Peiping but situation
                    apparently easing following student demonstration July 5. Strict curfew imposed
                    night July 6 from 7 p. m., to 7 a. m. Curfew for night July 7 scheduled to be 11
                    p. m. to 6 p. m. [<hi rendition="#italic">a. m.?</hi>]</p>
                <p>Repeated Shanghai 276, Nanking 416, Tientsin.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Touchette</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
